@NotificationService_HostAddress = http://localhost:5123
@token = your_token_here

### Get All Notifications
GET {{NotificationService_HostAddress}}/api/notification
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Get Unread Count
GET {{NotificationService_HostAddress}}/api/notification/unread-count
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Mark Notification As Read
PUT {{NotificationService_HostAddress}}/api/notification/1/read
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Mark All As Read
PUT {{NotificationService_HostAddress}}/api/notification/read-all
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
